  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 42e60d74fe4bd6a41be955446d44e70b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Batir
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Batir
  name: Batir
  IdleReplices:
  - "Long ago, they called me \u201Cstupid\u201D because I never struck with the
    blade\u2019s edge... only the flat."
  - Whatever happens, young batyr... listen to your heart!
  - "I may not be smart, but I\u2019ve never once turned my back on a fight."
  - "A true warrior doesn\u2019t think too much... he just stands."
  - My victories were never pretty. But they were mine.
  HoverReplices:
  - In your age I fought the Dzungars, not tried to save my skin using my ancestors.
  - "You hesitate too much. A blade doesn\u2019t hesitate."
  DragReplices:
  - "So you\u2019ve decided after all? Good. I may not be clever, but I won\u2019t
    go down without a fight."
  - Come on then! Show me what kind of warrior you are!
  PutInReplices:
  - "Then let\u2019s begin. I\u2019ll show you what I am still capable of!"
  bonusDescription: 
  damageFromCap: 1
